00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:26.540
In Russian culture, people love to talk about the weather.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.500
It is the most common small talk topic.

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.900
You will often hear a Russian say,

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:35.600
«ну и погода» with a big smile or a dramatic sigh.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.160
That means what weather?

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:42.800
Spring and autumn bring sudden changes, so Russians have many folk sayings about rain and sun.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:47.560
One popular children's rhyme about a rainbow turns the weather into a game.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:52.280
Kids count the colors and make wishes when they see a Raduga after the rain.

